flowchart TD
    Client[Client / Postman] --> Router[Gin Router]

    Router --> Public[Public Routes]
    Router --> Protected[Protected Routes]

    Public --> Health[Health Handler]
    Public --> Auth[Auth Handler]

    Protected --> AuthMiddleware[Auth Middleware]
    AuthMiddleware --> RoleMiddleware[Role Middleware]
    RoleMiddleware --> Handlers[HTTP Handlers]

    Handlers --> Services[Application Services]
    Services --> Repositories[Repositories]
    Repositories --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]

    Config[Config / Env] --> Router
    Config --> Services
    Security[JWT / Security] --> Auth
    Security --> AuthMiddleware
    Response[Response Standard] --> Handlers
    Migrations[SQL Migrations] --> DB
    Seeder[Seeder Admin] --> DB
